    K --> L[Cross-Stage Reconciliation\nreconciliation pass\ncontradiction detection gate\nreport readiness gate]

    L --> M[Stage 10: Report Generation\nrunReportGenerationStage\nclaimsDecisionAuthority\nvalidatedOutcomeRecorder]

    M --> N([return PipelineResult\nreport, summary\nassumptions, recoveryActions])

